From: ios-mh2lm
Subject: mh2lm: run key, DWC3 and touch drivers from IRQ events only

Fix the MH2LM runtime to the already demonstrated real IRQ paths. Remove
periodic recovery reads and silent polling fallback. On IRQ failure, mask
the affected source, log the fault and stop that function. The USB console
ring wakes its TX worker when bytes arrive or a transfer/configuration
completes, instead of scanning the ring every 20 ms. Finite startup waits
remain unchanged. The shared key and USB sources now use IRQ-only paths;
only the MH2LM build has been validated.

